      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10154406::web::004::introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "At approximately 8 dpa, Hf addition will lower the volume fraction of Cr/V-rich precipitates relative to the unmodified alloy.",
