      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Hf-induced local chemical environment reduces the driving force for Cr/V segregation at grain boundaries and in the matrix.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Hf addition modifies phase stability in the W-Ta-Cr-V alloy.",
